@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@email = owner.demo@mensaly.local
@password = replace-with-demo-seed-password
@organizationId = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Login (preserve the Set-Cookie value in your client)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Current owner and organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/session

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/organization

### Paginated operational data
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?page=1&pageSize=20&status=ACTIVE

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/charges?page=1&pageSize=20&status=PENDING

### Dashboard snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/overview

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/monthly-evolution?months=12

### Audit trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20

### Manual payment; replace IDs before executing
POST {{baseUrl}}/charges/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: manual:example:001

{
  "amountCents": 15000,
  "method": "PIX",
  "paidAt": "2026-07-29T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
